ecommendation to check this out. \n\nCant wait for future updates.", "timestamp_created": 1696090086, "timestamp_updated": 1696090086, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52173912525177002", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "147362808", "author": {"steamid": "76561197966692029", "personaname": "Whateverman", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Whateverman/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 60, "playtime_forever": 739, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 454, "last_played": 1696133743, "avatar": "f61a1c2e9ee05236d6cbc89add14976eb05b6cd9"}, "language": "english", "review": "Yes, you're a crab with an assault weapon.\n\nNo one notices the incongruity of it, though, because you're blowing the crap out of everything.  The mobs don't care, they're just trying (and failing) to survive; gamers don't care, because they're too busy melting faces.  And aside from shooting stuff, too much of it is blowing up to really spend time considering whether beach fauna should have the mental capacity to reload twin double barreled shotguns every few seconds.\n\nThis game is pure fun.  Seriously, buy it.", "timestamp_created": 1696086210, "timestamp_updated": 1696086210, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 32, "votes_funny": 9, "weighted_vote_score": "0.716530919075012207", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 13, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 1, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 5, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 6, "count": 1}]}]}